🚀 How to Run
Using Google Colab
Open CodeAlpha_Stock_Portfolio_Tracker.ipynb.
Open the notebook in Google Colab.
Run the code cells.
Enter the number of stocks.
Enter each stock symbol.
Enter the quantity.
View the portfolio summary.
Using Jupyter Notebook

Clone the repository:

git clone YOUR_GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL

Navigate to the project directory:

cd CodeAlpha_Stock_Portfolio_Tracker

Open the notebook using Jupyter Notebook or JupyterLab.

📄 Output File

The program generates:

portfolio_summary.txt

This file contains:

Stock symbol
Stock price
Quantity
Individual investment value
Total investment value

